  "problem": "$6÷\\frac{1}{5}=$",
  "worked_solution": "Dividing a whole number by a fraction is equivalent to multiplying the whole number by the reciprocal of the fraction.\n\nThe reciprocal of $\\frac{1}{5}$ is $5.$ \n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n6÷\\frac{1}{5}=6\\times 5=30.\n$$",
